  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">About our brand and products:</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Extend-A-Reach is a family-run brand on a mission to make high-reach cleaning safer, easier, and actually enjoyable. Our tools are designed to eliminate the need for ladders — helping customers clean windows, dust ceilings, change light bulbs, and more from the ground. We offer pro-grade, lightweight, and versatile extension poles paired with interchangeable heads for indoor and outdoor use.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Unlike other cleaning tools, Extend-A-Reach products combine smart design with real functionality. Every kit is an all-in-one solution — no more juggling separate tools or risking ladder accidents. We also give back: a portion of every sale supports cancer patients through our partnership with <strong>Cleaning for a Reason</strong>. Our customers love us for our sturdy build, thoughtful design, and 5-star customer support.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn a <strong>5% commission on orders under $150</strong> and <strong>10% on orders over $150</strong> — tracked via a 30-day cookie window. Commissions are paid monthly via bank transfer once you reach the $50 payout threshold. You can track your clicks, conversions, and earnings easily through your personal dashboard.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You can promote Extend-A-Reach through:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:12px;\"><p>Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube videos showing the tools in action</p></li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\"><p>Tutorials, cleaning tips, or before/after transformations</p></li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\"><p>Product reviews, unboxings, or blog posts</p></li><li style=\"font-size:12px;\"><p>Sharing your custom link and exclusive discount code in bios, stories, or emails</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Original content is highly encouraged — and we may even reshare your posts across our own channels.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>Other information:</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our top-sellers are the <strong>5-Piece High Reach Cleaning Kit</strong> and the <strong>Window Washing Kit</strong>. Whether your audience is into home improvement, cleaning, organizing, or DIY — Extend-A-Reach is a smart, practical product that resonates. We provide banners, product photos, and brand assets in your dashboard, and we're happy to support content ideas or collaborations.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Let’s help people clean smarter — and earn together.</span></p></div></div>",
